[I] A multi-purpose WAVE data processing and reporting utility

[T] shntool is a command line utility for processing and reporting on WAVE
[T] audio data. It can join, split, fix, compare and report on files, and
[T] its abstracted file format support lets it work on compressed formats
[T] such as FLAC, WavPack or Shorten as well.

[U] http://shnutils.freeshell.org/shntool/

[A] Shntool Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

